SUMMARY:Man of La Mancha - Manassas
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an unforgettable evening as the timeless musical "Man of La Mancha - Manassas" takes the stage at the Gregory Family Theater At Hylton Performing Arts Center! Set in the heart of Manassas\, Virginia\, this enchanting production invites you to journey alongside the dreamer Don Quixote as he battles the impossible with courage and imagination. The intimate atmosphere of the theater enhances the emotional depth of the story\, making it a perfect setting for this classic tale of hope and adventure. \nWhether you're a longtime fan of musical theater or new to the scene\, "Man of La Mancha - Manassas" promises to captivate your heart and soul. Experience the magic of live performance in a space that feels both grand and welcoming. Don’t miss your chance to witness this powerful story unfold—book your tickets now and be part of an evening filled with inspiration and artistry!
URL:https://historicmanassas.org/event/man-of-la-mancha-manassas-2/
LOCATION:Gregory Family Theater At Hylton Performing Arts Center\, 10960 GEORGE MASON CIR\, Manassas\, VA\, 20110\, United States
CATEGORIES:Theater
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://historicmanassas.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Man-Of-La-Mancha.jpg
END:VEVENT
