SUMMARY:Man of La Mancha - Manassas
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a captivating evening at the "Man of La Mancha - Manassas\," where the enchanting tale of Don Quixote comes to life on stage! Set in the intimate atmosphere of the Gregory Family Theater At Hylton Performing Arts Center\, this musical promises to transport you to a world of adventure\, dreams\, and the timeless quest for chivalry. With its stunning performances and heartfelt melodies\, you'll find yourself swept away by the magic of this classic story. \nDon't miss your chance to experience this unforgettable production in the charming city of Manassas\, Virginia. Gather your friends and family for a night filled with laughter\, inspiration\, and a little bit of whimsy. Book your tickets now and be part of this extraordinary theatrical journey!
URL:https://historicmanassas.org/event/man-of-la-mancha-manassas-5/
LOCATION:Gregory Family Theater At Hylton Performing Arts Center\, 10960 GEORGE MASON CIR\, Manassas\, VA\, 20110\, United States
