SUMMARY:Man of La Mancha - Manassas
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a magical evening at the Gregory Family Theater At Hylton Performing Arts Center as we present "Man of La Mancha - Manassas." This beloved musical transports you to a world of dreams and chivalry\, where the noble Don Quixote embarks on a quest to revive the age of knights. The intimate atmosphere of the theater enhances the emotional depth of the story\, making it a perfect setting for this timeless tale of hope and adventure. \nDon't miss your chance to experience the captivating performances and stirring melodies that have enchanted audiences for decades. Gather your friends and family for a night filled with laughter\, inspiration\, and unforgettable moments. Secure your seats now for "Man of La Mancha - Manassas" and be part of this extraordinary theatrical journey!
URL:https://historicmanassas.org/event/man-of-la-mancha-manassas/
LOCATION:Gregory Family Theater At Hylton Performing Arts Center\, 10960 GEORGE MASON CIR\, Manassas\, VA\, 20110\, United States
